4. TELECOMMUNICATIONS & CELLULAR USSD OPERATIONS
The Software functions as an on-device accessibility client that automates standard cellular
telecommunications dialogs over carrier signaling networks (e.g., *99# and related USSD protocols).
Licensee acknowledges that:
(a) All financial debits, credits, account queries, and authentications are executed directly
    by the Licensee's designated banking institution and telecom service provider;
(b) Arkio Labs Inc. does not operate a payment gateway, payment aggregator, or financial wallet;
(c) Arkio Labs Inc. neither handles nor stores customer funds, and has no capacity to reverse,
    reissue, refund, or alter confirmed banking transactions;
(d) Telecom carrier session fees and bank UPI limits apply independently of this Software.

5. ZERO-INTERNET & PRIVACY GUARANTEE
The Software is strictly engineered without the `android.permission.INTERNET` permission.
All credential processing, USSD session state parsing, contact lookup, and transaction logging
occur entirely locally on the user's device. Database records are encrypted at rest using
AES-256 (SQLCipher). Arkio Labs Inc. collects zero telemetry, zero analytics, zero location data,
and zero user credentials from the device.

